Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 08:58:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Persist V2 coins and compact authenticated tree in atomic
 LevelDB batches

Review correction: Persist V2 coins and compact authenticated tree in atomic LevelDB batches.

This isolated V2 implementation is module-tested; it does not establish
lotusd V2 block acceptance or select a network profile.
